{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34334","headline":"送宣武从事越中按狱 · 陆龟蒙","name":"送宣武从事越中按狱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓看呈使范，知欲敕星轺。\n水国难驱传，山城便倚桡。\n秉筹先独立，持法称高标。\n旌斾临危堞，金丝发丽谯。\n别愁当翠巘，冤望隔风潮。\n木落孤帆迥，江寒叠鼓飘。\n客鸿吴岛尽，残雪剡汀消。\n坐想休秦狱，春应到柳条。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}